-- description --
Fields that have the same value are compressed into a single line
-- input.json --
{
  "URL": "https://example.com",
  "Title": "Test Title",
  "OGType": "summary",
  "OGDescription": "This is a bio.",
  "TwitterCard": "summary",
  "TwitterDescription": "This is a bio."
}
-- expected.txt --
URL: https://example.com
Title: Test Title
Twitter and OpenGraph Card: summary
Twitter and OpenGraph Description: This is a bio.
